Changes from the original
  - AI glasses detection: alert on glasses company identifiers, the Meta
    glasses service code, the glasses appearance value and product names,
    without an empty-room record ("AI 안경 바로 탐지").
  - Screen-off monitoring of glasses signals through a foreground service.
  - A saved, shareable log of glasses signals per monitoring session.
  - Fixes: "확인함" scope, hidden Wi-Fi grouping, restoring Do Not Disturb
    after an abnormal exit.
  - Renamed the app, changed the application ID, and replaced the icon.
  Modified and added files are listed in CHANGELOG.md and in the git history.

The original KoriyoSCAN name and Koriyo icon are not used in this project.
The KoriyoSCAN NOTICE states that its name and icon are not licensed for use
as another product's name or logo.

Registry data shipped with the app (app/src/main/assets)
  mac-vendors.tsv: IEEE Registration Authority MA-L assignments.
  bluetooth-companies.tsv: Bluetooth SIG company identifiers.
  See app/src/main/assets/REGISTRY-SOURCES.txt for sources and retained fields.

Names
  Product and company names that appear in the code describe observed
  signals and do not imply endorsement.
